FEX on Android: chdir into a RootFS-only directory.

FileManager::Chdir makes the host chdir first. When it fails with ENOENT, ENOTDIR or EACCES for an
absolute path and a RootFS is configured, the path is opened in the RootFS (OpenInRoot, patch 0002)
and the process changes into it with fchdir. Relative paths such as Wine's server "socket" then
resolve in that RootFS directory; getcwd reports its host path.

